@startuml
title Activity - UC-03 Nhận thông báo tự động (Rules & Triggers)
start
:Identify triggers:
 - reminder before pickup
 - bus near stop
 - admin broadcast
 - driver updates;

if (Reminder scheduler tick?) then (yes)
  :Find upcoming trips per student;
  :Create reminder notifications;
endif

if (GPS event received?) then (yes)
  :Match to subscribed students by trip/stop;
  :Check distance threshold to stop;
  if (Within threshold?) then (yes)
    :Create "bus near" notification;
  endif
endif

if (Admin broadcast?) then (yes)
  :Select target audience;
  :Create emergency notification;
endif

:Enqueue notifications to push service (UC-17);
:Record notification logs;
stop
@enduml